
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FX TRADERS LTD</title>
<style>
:root {
  --gold: #d6ad55;
  --navy: #081323;
  --panel: #122238;
  --text: #f5f5f5;
  --muted: #aab6c5;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--text);
}
header {
  padding: 20px 6%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #29394d;
}
.logo { color: var(--gold); font-weight: bold; font-size: 21px; }
nav a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-left: 16px;
  font-size: 14px;
}
.notice {
  text-align: center;
  background: #302817;
  color: #f2d28c;
  padding: 10px;
  font-size: 12px;
}
.hero {
  padding: 75px 7%;
  text-align: center;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,#101f34,#081323);
}
.hero h1 { font-size: 38px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.hero h1 span { color: var(--gold); }
.hero p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
.tag {
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-size: 12px;
}
.button {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--gold);
  color: #101820;
  padding: 13px 23px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-top: 18px;
}
section { padding: 45px 6%; }
.section-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }
.section-title h2 { color: var(--gold); }
.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));
  gap: 18px;
}
.card {
  background: var(--panel);
  border: 1px solid #29394d;
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 23px;
  text-align: center;
}
.card h3 { color: var(--gold); }
.card p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
.chart {
  background: var(--panel);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: center;
}
footer {
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--muted);
  border-top: 1px solid #29394d;
  font-size: 13px;
}
.warning {
  background: #302817;
  border: 1px solid #80652d;
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 16px;
  color: #f2d28c;
  line-height: 1.6;
  font-size: 13px;
}
@media(max-width:600px) {
  header { flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; }
  nav a { margin: 0 7px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 29px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="notice">
  EDUCATIONAL DEMONSTRATION — NO REAL INVESTMENTS OR PAYMENTS
</div>

<header>
  <div class="logo">FX TRADERS LTD</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#packages">Packages</a>
    <a href="#gold">Gold</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="tag">LEARN • ANALYSE • UNDERSTAND</div>
  <h1>Explore the World of <span>Trading</span></h1>
  <p>
    Discover financial markets, explore gold-price movements
    and learn about trading through an educational demonstration.
  </p>
  <a href="#packages" class="button">Explore Demo Packages</a>
</div>

<section id="packages">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Demo Packages</h2>
    <p>Example educational access levels — not investment products.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>BRONZE</h3>
      <h2>$8</h2>
      <p>Basic trading education</p>
      <p>Market-learning materials</p>
      <p>Demo account experience</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>SILVER</h3>
      <h2>$15</h2>
      <p>Intermediate learning</p>
      <p>Technical analysis lessons</p>
      <p>Demo account experience</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>GOLD</h3>
      <h2>$25</h2>
      <p>Advanced learning topics</p>
      <p>Market analysis lessons</p>
      <p>Demo account experience</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="gold">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Gold Market</h2>
    <p>Explore gold market information.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="chart">
    <h3>XAU/USD — Gold vs US Dollar</h3>
    <p>Live market chart will be connected in a later step.</p>
    <p style="color:#d6ad55">Educational demonstration only</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>About FX TRADERS LTD</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="warning">
    This website is currently an educational prototype. It does not accept
    deposits, hold customer funds, execute trades, or promise investment
    returns. Trading involves risk, and profits are never guaranteed.
    Any future real-money service would require appropriate legal and
    regulatory review before launch.
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 FX TRADERS LTD. Educational demonstration.
</footer>

</body>
  </html>
  
